<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">VaFiripi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaFiripi</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaFiripi</para>
  <para style="toc3">VaF</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba raPhauro</para>
  <para style="mt1">kuvaVAFIRIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Phauro adonyora tsamba kuvatendi muFiripi mumakore makumi matanhatu noribodzi mumasure mokuberekewa kwaKhirisitu. Adorinyora ari mutorongo zvichida waiva muRoma (vaFiripi 1:13). Tsamba ridonyorehwa kuherekhe yanga iri muguta roFiripi. Tinogona kudzidza zvishoma pamusoro poguta roFiripi kubva mubhuku raMabasa. Firipi ndiro raiva guta rikuru mudunhu roMakedhoniya. Pakare ndiyo yanga iri kherekhe yokuthanga muMakedhoniya. Phauro naSairasi vadothanga kherekhe yakarei vari pabodzi uye vadotoisiwa mutorongo usiku hubodzi pavanga vari kwakareko (Mabasa 16:1-40).</para>
  <para style="ip">Phauro anogona kunge waiva nozvinangwa zvidowanda paadonyora tsamba rakareri. Adoshandisa chiitiko kutenda kherekhe nokuda kwochipo chavadotumira pavadonzva kuti ari mutorongo (vaFiripi 4:10-19). Uyewo adovatsanangurira chimiro chache mutorongo nokuvakurudzira kuti vatambire nokuremekedza utungamiri hwaTimoti naEpafurodhitasi mukherekhe (vaFiripi 2:19-30).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro adothanga tsamba yache nokumoresa kherekhe iri muFiripi (vaFiripi 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">Tevere anokovera mashoko pamusoro pomamiriro yozvinhu nozvaimutambudza pamusoro pavo (vaFiripi 1:3—2:30).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndokudzopasa rairo idotikuti pamusoro pokurarama kwochiKhirisitu (vaFiripi 3:1—4:9).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisira nokutenda kherekhe yopaFiripi nokuda kwochipo chavo uye nokuvamoresa (vaFiripi 4:10-23).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Phauro naTimoti, varanda vaKhirisitu Jesu, kuvatsvene vese vomuna Khirisitu Jesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">vari kuFiripi, pabodzi noVatariri noVabatsiri.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Mutsa norugare zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba vedu naIshe Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato waPhauro kuVaverengi vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ndinotenda Mwari wangu pese pandinokufungai, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />paminamato yangu yese yandinokunamatirai mese ndinonamata nguwa dzese nomufaro, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />nokuda kwokubatirana kwenyu nesu muVhangeri kubva pazuva rokuthanga kusvikira ipopano. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Futi ndinochokwadi chokuti iye adothanga basa ridonaka mamuri acharipedzisa pazuva raKhirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Zvidokohoroka kwandiri kuti ndinzve zvidodai nokuda kwenyu mese, ndava ndinemi mumwoyo mangu, nokuti mese muri vakoverani vomutsa nainini, pese pandanga ndiri muusungwa ndichidzivirira nokusimbisa vhangeri. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nokuti Mwari ndiye pfakazi yangu, kuti mese ndinokusuvai maninge norudo raKhirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Futi ndiwo munamato wangu kuti rudo renyu rirambe richiwanditsa, pabodzi nokuziva nokunzvitsitsa, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kuti mukwanise kuziva kusarudza zvidonakitsa mudochena, musinai chamunganenedzehwe kusvika pazuva raKhirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />mudozaziwa nomichero yokururama inouya kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu, kuti zvipase mbiri nokurumbidziwa kwaMwari.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurarama ndiKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Hama, ndinoda kuti muzive kuti, zvidoitika kwandiri zvidotobatsira kuendesa vhangeri pamberi. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Zvokutoti zvidodzozikana mumuzinda wese wovarindi nokunovese kuti kusungiwa kwangu kudoitiwa nokuda kwaKhirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />nondava yokusungiwa kwangu hama dzizinji muna Ishe dzidoita zvivindi zvokunyaira shoko raMwari noushingi dzisingache.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Vamwe vanotoparidza Khirisitu nochanje uye nomungu, asi vamwe nochido kwacho. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Avo vanozviita murudo, vanoziva kuti ndidoisiwa pano nondava yokudziirira vhangeri, <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />vomungu vanoparidza Khirisitu zvichibva pakuzvisarudzira, aikona pamwoyo udonaka vachifunga kuti vachanyanya kukonzera matambudziko pakusungiwa kwangu.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Hazvinai basa, inini ndinofara kuti Khirisitu anondoparidziwa nonzira dzidosiyana siyana zvingave zvomwoyo muchena kana zvochanje ndicharamba ndichifara, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />nokuti ndinoziva kuti kuburikidza nominamato yenyu uye nokubatsira kunobva kuMweya waJesu Khirisitu ndichaponesewa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ndinokugurupira kudonyanya notariro kuti ndinonyadzisiwaba nochinhu chipi zvachene asi mukunyaira kwangu ndichava noushingi hudozara, kuti zvino sepanguwa dzese Khirisitu achakudziwa mumuviri mangu zvisinei kuti ndinorarama kana kuti ndinopfa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Nokuti kwandiri inipano kurarama ndiKhirisitu, uye kupfa kupfuma. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Manje kana kuri kurarama mumuviri, zvichandipasa zvibereko zvokushanda kwangu, ndichazivaba popa chandichasarura. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Zvino ndinomanikidziwa pakati pozvinhu zviiri. Ndinoditsitsa kusiya upenyu huno kuti ndive naKhirisitu, chinova chinhu chidonakitsa, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />asi nokuda kwenyu imipa zvidokosha chaizvo kuti ndirambe ndiri mumuviri uno, <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Zvino ndinochokwadi, uye ndinoziva kuti ndichagara naimipa mese kuti mupfuurire pamberi muchifara pakutenda, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />kuitira kuti kuva kwangu nemi munova nochikonzero chidoingidzika chokuzvirumbidza kwenyu muna Khirisitu Jesu, nokuda kwangu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Asi raramai basi zvinoenderana novhangeri raKhirisitu, kuti kunyange ndikauya kudzokuonai kana kuti ndisipo, ndinzve pamusoro penyu kuti mudomira nosimba mumweya mubodzi, uye nomupfungwa ibodzi muchihwira kutenda kwovhangeri, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />musingavhundutsiwe kana nochinhu chibodzi chovanohwisana nemi, zvakarezvi ndizvo zvichava chiratidzo chokuparadziwa kwavari, asi kwamuri chokuponesewa kunobva kunaMwari. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Nokuti mudotendehwa nokuda kwaKhirisitu kuti imipa mureke kundotenda basi kwaari asi kuti mutambudzikewo nokuda kwache, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />hwisanaiwo nokuhwa kwakareku kwamudoona kwandiri kwamunonzva kuti ndichiri kuhwa nanasi.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuzvidikipisa noUkuru hwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Saka kana muna Khirisitu munokukurudzira, nokunyaradza kworudo, kana kubatirana paMweya, kana munounyoro nokunzvirana tsitsi, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />zazisai mufaro wangu nokuva nopfungwa ibodzi, muve norudo rubodzi nomweya mubodzi uye nokufunga kubodzi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Rekai kuita chinhu nonharo kana nomanyemwe, asi nokuzvidikipisa umwe noumwe mbaati vamwe vanomukunda pabuya. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Umwe noumwe mbaareke kunangara zvinhu zvidonakira iye basi, asi mbaanangarewo nozvidonakirawo abiyache. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ivai nomufungo uyu pakati penyu wanga uri muna Khirisitu Jesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />iye kunyange wanga adofanana naMwari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">haanai kuti kuenzana naMwari chinhu chinofanira kubatitsitsiwa,<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />asi adosiya zvaanga ari achitora unhu hwomuranda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">adozvariwa ari muchimiro chovanhu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Uye adoti wawanika muchimiro chomunhu adozvidukupisa ndokutetekera kusvikira paipfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">iyo ipfa yopamuchinjikwa.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Nokudaro Mwari adomukwiridzira pamusorosoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">ndokumupasa zita riri pamusoro pomazita yese,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />kuti muzita raJesu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">mabvi yese yapfugame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">yovari kudenga novari panyika noyovari pasi ponyika,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />uye ndimi dzese dzipfakaze kuti Jesu Khirisitu ndiye Ishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">kuti Mwari Baba varumbidziwe.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvhenekera seZviedza muNyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Naizvozvo, hama sezvamudotetekera nguwa dzese aikona pandanga ndiripo chete, asi kunyanya iyezvino pandisipo, pedzisai basa rokuponesewa kwenyu nokucha nokutetemera, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />nokuti Mwari ari kushanda mukati menyu ndiye anoita zvese kuti mufarire nokuita chido chache chidonaka.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Itai zvinhu zvese musinganyunyute kana kuita nharo, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />kuti muve vanhu vasinai chavanonenedzehwa novadochena, vana vaMwari vasinai murandu pakati porudzi ridopombonyoka, ridotaika ramuri pakati parene muchivhenekera kunge nyenyedzi mudenga, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />mudobatitsitsa shoko roupenyu, kuitira kuti pazuva raKhirisitu ndidade ndizive kuti handinai kumhanyira pasina kana kushandira mahara.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Kunyange ndikatoduruhwa kunge chibairo pamusoro pokuzvipira kwokutenda kwenyu, ndinofara nokufaritsa naimipa mese. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Zvibodzibodzi naimipa munofanira kufarawo pabodzi nainini.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti naEpafurodhitasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ndinotarisiro muna Ishe Jesu kuti ndichatuma Timoti nokamangu kwamuri, kuitira kuti ndifadziwe nokunzva hwenye pamusoro penyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nokuti handinai umwe adofanana naye, iye achava nohanya chaizvo pamusoro penyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Ndava vamwe vese vanozvitsvagira zvavo pachavo, zvisiri zvaJesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Asi Timoti munoziva kutendeka kwache, kuti fanike baba nomwanakomana wavo, adoshanda pabodzi nainipano muvhangeri. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />naizvozvo ndinotarisiro yokumutuma kwamuri mumasure mokunge ndaziva kuti zvinhu zvichandifambira tini. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Uye ndinotenda muna Ishe kuti inini pachangu ndichauyawo pasinai nonhangwe yese.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Manje ndidozviona zvidokodzera kuti nditume Epafurodhitasi kwamuri hama yangu nomubatsiri wangu pabasa uye muhwi pabodzi nainipano, ari mutumwa wenyu nomushumiri wangu pano zvandinosaya. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Nokuti wanga achikusuvitsai mese, uye adoshungurudzika chaizvo nondava yokuti mudonzva kuti wanga achihwara. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ichokwadi chaicho wanga achihwara, zvokutoda kupfa. Asi Mwari adomunzvira tsitsi, asiri iye chete asi nainipanowo kuti ndireke kuingidzihwa kusuwa pamusoro pokusuwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Nokudaro ndinoda maninge kumutuma iye kwamuri, kuti mufare pamunomuona pakare uye kuti nainipanowo ndireke kunetseka. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Saka mutambirei nomufaro wese muna Ishe; uye muremekedze vanhu vadodai, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />nokuti adopotsa wapfira basa raKhirisitu, adoisa upenyu hwache panjodzi achikuitirai basa ramudotadza kundiitira.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Kururama kwoChokwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Pakupedzisira, hama dzangu, farai muna Ishe. Inipano nosemburiwaba nokukunyorerai zvinhu zvibodzibodzi zviye, nokuti zvinokusimbisai. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Chenjererai vanenge imbwa, chenjererai vanoita zvidoipa, chenjererai vaye vanocheka muviri. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Nokuti vadochecheudziwa pachokwadi nhisu, vanonamata noMweya waMwari nhisu vanozvirumbidza muna Khirisitu Jesu, tisingavimbe nonyama. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Kunyange zvazvo inipano pachangu ndinachowo chikonzero chokuvimba nonyama. Kana kuno umwe munhu anofunga kuti anacho chikonzero chokuvimba nonyama inipano ndidosokoka, <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />ndidochecheudziwa nozuva rochisere, ndiri nzvahwa yorudzi rovaIzirairi, woimba yaBhenjamini, muHebheru wovaHebheru, pamutemo ndiri muFarisi, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />pakushingirira kwangu ndidotambudza kherekhe, pakururama pasi pomutemo handinai chandinganenedzehwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Asi zvese zvandidowana kare, ndidozviita zvinhu zvomangamanga nokuda kwaKhirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Pamusoro pozvakarezvo zvinhu zvese zvidova zvomangamanga kwandiri nokuda kwokunaka kudopindiridza kwokuziva Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wangu. Nokuda kwache ndidotaikihwa nozvinhu zvese, uye zvinhu zvese ndidozviita manyara, kuitira kuti ndiwane Khirisitu <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />kuti ndiwanike ndiri maari ndisinai kururama kwangu ndega, kudobva pamutemo, asi kunouya kuburikidza nokutenda muna Khirisitu, kururama kunobva kunaMwari nonzira yokutenda, <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />kuti ndimuzive iye nosimba rokumuka kwache, nokusangana naye pakutambudzika kwache, ndifanane naye mukupfa kwache, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />kuti ndisvikewo pakumuka kubva kuvadopfa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumhanya Kuenda Paudonanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Aikona kuti ndidochiwana kare kana kuti ndatosvika kare, asi ndinoshingirira kuti ndichibate icho Khirisitu Jesu chaadondibatira. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Hama dzangu, inipano handisi kuti ndatochibata, asi chinhu chibodzi chandinoita nyhichi, ndinokangamwa zviri kumasure ndichinanairira zviri kumberi, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />saka ndinomhanya ndidonanga padotariwa kuitira kuti ndipasiwe mubairo wokumusoro wandidodaidzihwa naMwari muna Khirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Nokudaro isisu tese takura mbativei nomurangariro udodaro, kana imipa munoumwe murangariro udosiyana, Mwari achakuisirai pachenu zvakarezvo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Asi mbatibatitsitsei pachokwadi izvo zvatawana.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Hama dzangu, nditeedzerei. Cherechedzai avo vanorarama nomuenzaniso wamudowana kuna isisu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nokuti mbazinji, vandidokunyepai kadowanda uye nanasi ndinokunyepai ndichirira, vanorarama vari vavengi vomuchinjikwa waKirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Magumo yavo kuparadziwa, mwari wavo mimba yavo, vanozvitutumadza pamusoro pozvinonyadzisa zvavo, vanofunga zvinhu zvomunyika. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Asi isisu unzvahwa hwedu huri kudenga, uye kubva kwariri tidomirira Muponisi, Ishe Jesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />uyo achasandura miviri yedu idovhuwa kuti ifanane nomuviri wache unobhwinya, nosimba iro raanokona naro iye kuzviisira zvinhu zvese pasi pache.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuraira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Naizvozvo hama dzangu, vandinoda novandinosuva, mufaro wangu nokorona yangu, mirai mudosimba muna Ishe ndonzira yamunofanira kumira nayo, vadikani vangu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ndinokumbira zvikuru Yudhiya naSindike kuti vawirirane muna Ishe. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Naiwepawo pakare, shamwari yangu yochokwadi pabasa, ndinokumbira kuti ubatsire vanhukadzi vakareva, nokuti vadoshanda neni muvhangeri, pabodzi naKeremenzi novese vandidoshanda navo, mazita yavo yari mubhuku roupenyu.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Farai muna Ishe nguwa dzese, ndichaingidza pakamu, Farai.<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Unyoro hwenyu mbahuzikane novanhu vese. Ishe wava papfupi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Rekai kunetseka pamusoro pochinhu kana nochibodzi zvachene, asi pazvinhu zvese kukumbira kwenyu mbakuzivisiwe Mwari kuburikidza nomunyengetero, nokukumbira, pabodzi nokupasa kutenda. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Zvino rugare raMwari, rinokunda kunzvitsitsa kwese, richachengeta mwoyo yenyu nomifungo yenyu muna Khirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Pakupedzisira, hama dzangu, zvese zvochokwadi, nozvese zvinokudziwa, zvese zvidorurama, zvese zvidochena, chese chidonaka, zvese zvinorumbidziwa, kana panokunaka kana kurumbidziwa kupi nokupi, fungitsitsai zvinhu zvakarezvi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Zvese zvamudodzidza nozvamudotambira nozvamudonzva nozvamudoona mandiri, itai zvakarezvo, ipopo Mwari worugare achava nemi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhendo pamusoro poChipo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ndinofara maninge muna Ishe kuti iyezvino mamutsiridza hanya yenyu neni, manga munohanya chaizvo neni, asi mudosaya mukana wokuzvinangidza. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ndinorevaba zvakarezvi nokuda kwokuti ndinosaya, nokuti inipano ndidodzidza, panozvese kugutsikana nozvandinazvo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ndinoziva urombo, futi ndinozivawo kuva nozvidowanda; pachinhu chipi nochipi nopazvinhu zvese ndidodzidza chidosvisvika chokuziva kuguta nokunzva nzara, kuva nozvidowanda nokusaya. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Ndinoita zvese kuburikidza naiye anondipasa simba.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kunyange zvidodaro mudoita zvidonaka kukovana nainini pamatambudziko yangu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Uye imipa vaFiripi pachenyu munoziva kuti pandidothanga kuparidza kuMakedhoniya, hapanai kherekhe idobatirana nainini mukupa nokutambira kunze kwenyu imipa basi, <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />nokuti nopandanga ndiri muThesaronika ndichida kuyamuhwa mudonditumira kanodarika kabodzi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Kusiri kuti ndiri kutsvaga chipo, asi ndinotsvaga zvinodzokubatsirai imipa. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ndidotambira mubhadharo udozara, ndava nozvidowanda, ndagutsiwa, ndatambira kubva kunaEpafurodhitasi zvipo zvamudotumira, zvidoita kunge hwema hunonushira nomupiro, nochibairo chinotambihwa futi chinofadza Mwari. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Zvino Mwari wangu achazazisa kushaiwa kwenyu kwese kubva papfuma yache mukubhwinya muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Zvino kunaMwari Baba vedu mbakuve nokubhwinya nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresa kwoKupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ndimoreserei mutsvene umwe noumwe muna Khirisitu Jesu. Hama dzandinadzo dziri kukumoresai. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Vatsvene vese vanokumoresai kunyanya voimba yaKhesari.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Mutsa waIshe Jesu Khirisitu mbadzive nomweya wenyu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>